  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB26129",
    "sub_id": "64515",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. 課堂學習：10%（學習討論、課堂互動）</div>\n\n<div>2. 點名：出席狀況</div>\n\n<div>3. 三次作業成績：75%（各佔25%，作品成績衡量標準：完整度、切題、創意與表達）</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. 同學應準時上下課，課堂上請遵守上課秩序，不得有影響上課脫序行為。\n2. 課堂與同學互動時，務必尊重多元文化與性別平權等問題。\n3. 作品創作與發表時，請尊重不同立場的政治、民族、國籍或宗教，切勿有歧視、嘲諷、言詞霸凌等行為。",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Students should arrive and leave get out of class on time. Please abide by the order in class and do not behave in a disorderly manner that may affect class.\n2. When interacting with classmates in class, be sure to respect issues such as multiculturalism and gender equality.\n3. When making works, please respect different political and religious attitudes, and do not engage in discrimination, ridicule, verbal bullying, etc.",
    "course_rem": "1. 因老師到校時間有限，因此請益時間可以先預約。如果課程內容或作業上有任何問題，請盡快與我討論，以便我們一起解決學習或創作上的問題。\n2. 外籍同學也歡迎選修，這堂課非常歡迎多元文化的交流與創作上的多元探討。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1.&nbsp;作業需親自進行創作，不可抄襲或盜用他人作品。影像、影音創作時，也請注意影音的版權問題。</div>\n\n<div>2. 創作過程中，若需引用他人資料時，必須清楚記載出處來源。</div>\n\n<div>3. 課程提供之講義、作品、影音等資料，僅供自我學習之用，請勿私下流傳。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Students must understand all concepts and meanings related to academic integrity; It is the responsibility of the school&nbsp;<br />\nadministrative team and teachers to promote students&#39; skills to use and develop these concepts in their daily work.&nbsp;<br />\nThis class regards academic integrity as a set of good values and skills, emphasizing &quot;authenticity&quot; and &quot;intellectual property rights&quot;.&nbsp;<br />\n&quot;Authenticity&quot; means that the works submitted by students (whether written, oral, visual, or audio) must be based on their ideas and expressed in their language. When using other sources or quoting other people&#39;s works, they must abide by academic norms and be quoted correctly.&nbsp;<br />\n&quot;Intellectual property rights&quot; emphasizes that all forms of creativity and intellectual expression must be respected and protected by national and international laws.&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
